<title>INDIA: India Cochin Refineries 1996/97 net falls.</title>
<headline>India Cochin Refineries 1996/97 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	    (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	 844.0    vs	 1,110.8</p>
<p>    Net sales     39,059.7    vs	33,510.3</p>
<p>    Other income     122.5    vs	   160.4</p>
<p>    Interest	   385.0    vs	   424.3</p>
<p>    Expenditure   37,377.2    vs	31,337.6</p>
<p>    Gross profit   1,420.0    vs	 1,908.8</p>
<p>    Depreciation     450.0    vs	   498.0</p>
<p>    Tax		  126.0    vs	   300.0</p>
<p>Note - State-run Cochin Refineries Ltd said the latest results are unaudited. It did not give reasons for the fall in profits.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
